 "visits": {
  "_about": "The visit types (R2.2). `from` is the first level the type is drawn in a morning; the lab can run any type at any level. minTested: the shared ear rule (R3.5): the ear star needs no miss AND at least this many graded rows that were neither taught (word stage 1) nor settled through the '?' rung. In V4 the doctor examines the part the child named himself (R3.4 S3), and its test is the voice star (the production moment): with only the treatment left to hear (V3's rows, measured under V3) a V4 shows no ear slot in phase 1; the leak bot found that the treatment alone is too few rows to grade fairly. A visit with fewer tested rows than minTested shows no ear slot (its rows still play), the same rule as the voice slot.",
