 "bot": {
  "_about": "build/leak_clinic.mjs: the audio-duration model the 'duration' strategy sees (it never sees the words). A line's length is its frame's length plus the word's letters, times a per-take jitter; three takes per line as the family would record. `weber`: a listener hears a line's length only to within this fraction (the Weber fraction for durations around a second is about 0.1-0.2), so the bot can't fingerprint a recording by milliseconds.",
  "secPerChar": 0.075,
  "frameSec": 0.55,
  "jitter": 0.18,
  "takes": 3,
  "weber": 0.12
 },
